export const takeClockSources=[['game','게임 시간'],['unscaled','배율 무시'],['platform','플랫폼 시계']];
export const takeClockMaxStart=Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER-240*86400;
export function resolveTakeClock(value){if(value===undefined)return {version:1,source:'game',startFrame:0};if(!value||typeof value!=='object'||Array.isArray(value)||Object.keys(value).some(k=>!['version','source','startFrame'].includes(k)))throw Error('녹화 시계 설정을 확인하세요.');const clock={version:1,source:'game',startFrame:0,...value};if(clock.version!==1||!takeClockSources.some(([key])=>key===clock.source)||!Number.isSafeInteger(clock.startFrame)||clock.startFrame<0||clock.startFrame>takeClockMaxStart)throw Error('녹화 시간 기준·시작 프레임을 확인하세요.');return clock;}
export function validTakeClock(value){try{return value?.version===1&&!!resolveTakeClock(value);}catch{return false;}}
const validRate=fps=>Number.isInteger(fps)&&fps>=1&&fps<=240;
export function takeTimecodeFrame(clock,time,fps){if(!validRate(fps)||!Number.isFinite(time)||time<0||time>86400)throw Error('타임코드 FPS·시간을 확인하세요.');const scaled=time*fps;return resolveTakeClock(clock).startFrame+Math.floor(scaled+4*Number.EPSILON*Math.max(1,scaled));}
export function formatTakeTimecode(frame,fps){if(!Number.isSafeInteger(frame)||frame<0||!validRate(fps))throw Error('타임코드 프레임을 확인하세요.');const f=BigInt(frame),rate=BigInt(fps),seconds=f/rate,days=seconds/86400n,pad=v=>String(v).padStart(2,'0');return (days?days+'d ':'')+[pad(seconds/3600n%24n),pad(seconds/60n%60n),pad(seconds%60n),pad(f%rate)].join(':');}
export function parseTakeTimecode(text,fps){if(typeof text!=='string'||text.length>64||!validRate(fps))throw Error('타임코드를 확인하세요.');const m=/^(?:(\d+)d )?(\d{2}):(\d{2}):(\d{2}):(\d{2,3})$/.exec(text.trim());if(!m||Number(m[2])>=24||Number(m[3])>=60||Number(m[4])>=60||Number(m[5])>=fps)throw Error('타임코드는 HH:MM:SS:FF로 입력하세요.');const f=((BigInt(m[1]||0)*86400n+BigInt(m[2])*3600n+BigInt(m[3])*60n+BigInt(m[4]))*BigInt(fps))+BigInt(m[5]);if(f>BigInt(takeClockMaxStart))throw Error('시작 타임코드 범위를 확인하세요.');return Number(f);}
export class TakeClock {
 constructor(settings,now=()=>performance.now()){this.settings=Object.freeze(resolveTakeClock(settings));this.now=now;this.compensation=0;this.last=0;if(this.settings.source==='platform'){const epoch=now();if(!Number.isFinite(epoch))throw Error('플랫폼 시계를 읽을 수 없어요.');this.epoch=this.previousNow=epoch;}}
 advance(current,delta,unscaled=delta){if(!Number.isFinite(delta)||delta<0||!Number.isFinite(unscaled)||unscaled<0)throw Error('녹화 프레임 시간을 확인하세요.');let next;if(this.settings.source==='platform'){const now=this.now();if(!Number.isFinite(now)||now<this.previousNow)throw Error('플랫폼 시계가 역행했어요.');this.previousNow=now;next=(now-this.epoch)/1000;}else{const step=this.settings.source==='unscaled'?unscaled:delta;if(!step)return current;if(this.last!==current)this.compensation=0;const adjusted=step-this.compensation;next=current+adjusted;this.compensation=(next-current)-adjusted;this.last=next;}if(!Number.isFinite(next)||next<current||next>86400)throw Error('녹화 시계 범위를 확인하세요.');return next;}
}
export const takeClockContract={field:'clock / sequence.recordingClock',shape:'{version:1,source:game|unscaled|platform,startFrame:nonnegative safe integer}',sources:{game:'scaled completed world tick, editor pause freezes',unscaled:'completed unscaled world tick, editor pause freezes',platform:'monotonic performance clock since Take start; ignores scale/pause, samples frozen pose on existing editor frames when paused; unavailable during a blocked frame'},timecode:'integer fps1..240, non-drop HH:MM:SS:FF with optional days; origin is metadata, sequence keys stay relative seconds',remaining:['Fractional/drop-frame rates','Audio/PCM/external/genlock/timecode providers','Platform sampling while the UI thread is suspended']};
